// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Safe rule evaluator
//
// Supports a restricted set of comparison/logical expressions over the
// caller-supplied `context` object.  Uses an explicit allow-list of
// operators and property-path resolution so that no arbitrary code can
// ever be executed.
//
